flowchart TD
    accTitle: Billy's continuous preparation and human review workflow
    accDescr: Company evidence and shared opportunities feed a sequential Autopilot queue on Vultr. Billy picks an RFP into My RFPs as Researching, saves cited requirements and drafts, exports a review PDF, and continues to the next suitable RFP without waiting for human review. The user reviews each response and follows agency submission instructions. Automated delivery is not connected.
    A["Company files, website and reported facts"] --> B["Saved company profile and source citations"]
    C["Watched-source discoveries + shared catalog"] --> D["Evaluate fit, geography and deadlines"]
    B --> D
    U["Start Autopilot"] --> D
    D --> E["Pick one RFP → My RFPs: Researching"]
    E --> F["Read extracted originals + cite requirements"]
    F --> G["Save sections + explicit gaps → Drafting"]
    G --> H["Current review PDF → Ready for review"]
    H -->|"Immediately find next suitable match"| D
    F -->|"Individual source blocker"| K["Retain reason and skip this item"]
    K --> D
    H --> R["You review PDF, deadline and unresolved details"]
    R --> S["Open agency source and submission instructions"]
    S --> T["You submit through the agency; Billy sends nothing"]
    D -->|"No suitable matches or whole-job blocker"| X["Stop with a reason"]
    P["Pause / Continue preserves queue progress"] -.-> D
    M["Vultr inference chooses bounded actions; VM stores work"] -.-> F
    classDef work fill:#e6ecdf,stroke:#8caa7c,color:#172b29
    classDef human fill:#176349,stroke:#176349,color:#ffffff
    classDef output fill:#fff6df,stroke:#c8ad6d,color:#172b29
    class B,C,D,E,F,G,K,M work
    class A,U,R,S,T,P human
    class H,X output
